        <p>WIDNES AND WARRINGTON. OHN R. GOODWIN continues to make ADVANCES t/ PRIVATELY to Tradesmen. Farmers, Workingmen. and all respectable Householder, on their own security. MONEY TO INCREASE YOUR STOCK. MONLY TO FURNISH YOUR HOUSE. MONEY TO PAY RENT OR DEBTS. Without Bondsmen, without delay, without public enquiry on your simple written promise to pay back. Apply VICTORIA CHAMBERS (foot of the Central Station), WIDNE, WARRINGTON at nu Residence, 134. Orford-lane any Evening. Applications from RUNCORN and District generalt receive precisely the same attention. Loans in sums of £.5, £7, £lO, £23. £3O, £l3O and upwards.</p>
        <p>I T ONDON AND PROVINCIAL LOAN COMPANY. LOANS £3 TO £5OO DAILY. TO ALL RESPECTABLE HOUSEHOLDERS, and others. with or without sureties and STRICTLY PRIVATE. also LOANS wanted on ordinary Life Assurance Policies, Reversions, Life Interests, Freehold and Leasehold Property. £3 repayable 1/6 per wk. £2C repayable 10/-per wk. £5 „ 2/6 „ £25 „ 12/6 ~ £lO „ 5/- „ £3O „ 15/- .. £l5 ;, 7/6 .. £35 „ 17/6 „ No Fees or Fines Charged. Letters with a stamp will receive prompt attention. Office Hours 9to 2, and 6to 8 p.m. Saturdays 9to 1 p.m. Apply to JOSI,PII WADSWORTH, District hgent. 121, Mersey-street, Warrington. --</p>
