        <p>MONEY LENT PRIVATELY FROM £lO UPWANDS. ON BORROWER'S OWN PROMISSOEY NOTE. The undersigned has been established for nearly 30 years, and has always conducted BUSINESS ander HIS OWN NAM-4. He has always e:ideavoured to act in a fate and straightforward manner, and has received MANE HUNDREDS OF Lill-TEES of APPRECIATION and THANKS from those who have dealt with him. NU PRELIMINARY FEES CHARGED. NO BILLS OF SALE TAKEN. PROMPT ATTENTION TO ENQUIRIES.</p>
