ength, and I became stronger and stronger $9O continued taking the pills. The eczema also leas entirely gone. My appetite had been very bad, btl' IS beginning to take the pills I was able to eat and te about quite well. Ever since they have centianed toeuf, me good. I have taken nine or ten boxes altogot, and my husband tells me I must never be without i'e Williams' pink pills. I have done all that this mornieg'of and Mrs Fronk painted through the window to a rd,r/rpoo spotlessly white linen banging in the garden. " honestly say that there is no medicine like Dr. pink. _Ole. Had __l commenced taking them befor'</p>
